# Basic C++ Project

Small starter project that demonstrates how to structure a C++17 codebase with
separate headers, sources, and a CMake build.

## Layout
- `include/` shared headers for simple math and string helpers
- `src/` library implementations plus a demo `main.cpp`
- `CMakeLists.txt` builds the helper library and demo executable

## Build and run
```
cmake -S . -B build
cmake --build build
./build/basic_cpp_app
```

## Tests
A smoke test ensures the demo executable runs without crashing:
```
ctest --test-dir build
```
